Package: orbivisor
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Orbivisor developers <gaiger777@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libssl3t64, qemu-system-x86, qemu-utils, ovmf, iproute2, iputils-ping, nftables, systemd
Recommends: nfs-common, lvm2, thin-provisioning-tools, open-iscsi, lvm2-lockd, sanlock, ceph-common, iputils-arping
Breaks: oplite (<< @VERSION@)
Replaces: oplite (<< @VERSION@)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/gaiger777/opLite
Description: Orbivisor virtualization platform node
 Orbivisor runs QEMU/KVM virtual machines on a cluster of Linux nodes.
 This package installs the node daemon orbivisord (with the web UI), the
 command line tool orbivisorctl, the opld systemd unit and the
 compatibility names opld and oplctl.
